! FedGrid variant of the IEEE EU LV Test Feeder Master.dss (the data-simulation module).
! Identical to the pristine Master.dss vendored alongside, except:
!   * the Monitors.txt redirect is omitted (906 monitors are irrelevant to our
!     co-simulation loop and slow every step; we read circuit state via the API),
!   * the energymeter and the trailing solve are omitted (FeederSim issues its
!     own solve sequence and options).
! All component files (LineCode/LoadShapes/Lines/Transformers/Loads/Buscoords)
! are the unmodified IEEE PES / EPRI distribution files.

clear

Set DefaultBaseFrequency=50  ! for European system

New circuit.LVTest
Edit Vsource.Source BasekV=11 pu=1.05  ISC3=3000  ISC1=5
Redirect LineCode.txt
Redirect LoadShapes.txt
batchedit loadshape..* useactual=no
Redirect Lines.txt
Redirect Transformers.txt
Redirect Loads.txt

Set voltagebases=[11  .416]
Calcvoltagebases

buscoords Buscoords.txt
